{"id":343,"flavor":[{"games":["Shield","LeafGreen","FireRed"],"text":"It was discovered in ancient ruins. While moving, it constantly spins. It stands on one foot even when asleep."},{"games":["Sword","X","SoulSilver","HeartGold"],"text":"It moves while spinning around on its single foot. Some Baltoy have been seen spinning on their heads."},{"games":["Ultra Moon"],"text":"When they find others of their kind, they cry out loudly and gather together. Large numbers of them can be found in old graveyards."},{"games":["Ultra Sun"],"text":"Depictions of Pokémon similar to Baltoy have been found on the walls of caves where primitive humans lived."},{"games":["Alpha Sapphire","Sapphire"],"text":"As soon as it spots others of its kind, Baltoy congregates with them and then begins crying noisily in unison. This Pokémon sleeps while cleverly balancing itself on its one foot."},{"games":["Omega Ruby","Ruby"],"text":"Baltoy moves while spinning around on its one foot. Primitive wall paintings depicting this Pokémon living among people were discovered in some ancient ruins."},{"games":["Y","White","Black","Platinum","Pearl","Diamond"],"text":"It moves by spinning on its foot. It is a rare Pokémon that was discovered in ancient ruins."},{"games":["White 2","Black 2"],"text":"Discovered in ancient ruins, it moves by spinning around and forms a group when it finds others."},{"games":["Emerald"],"text":"A BALTOY moves by spinning on its single foot. It has been depicted in murals adorning the walls of a once-bustling city in an ancient age."}],"abilities":[{"name":"Levitate","hidden":false,"description":"By floating in the air, the Pokémon receives full immunity to all Ground-type moves."}],"eggGroups":["Mineral"],"genderRate":-1,"hatchCounter":20,"baseHappiness":70,"growthRate":"medium","habitat":"rough terrain","color":"Brown","shape":"Arms","evolution":{"id":343,"name":"Baltoy","condition":null,"children":[{"id":344,"name":"Claydol","condition":"Lv. 36","children":[]}]},"moves":{